      },
      "text": "10-Day Colombia Tour: Bogotá, Medellín and Cartagena with a Coffee Tour"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d82e0ce885d247a9fb0233e7f7cd7680915522ac5a4dd4272e211a72fe511230",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-337d155f29274612b31edc8084c70ab0",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "This 10-day trip explores several sides of Colombia. In Bogotá, visit the historic centre, the Gold Museum and the Botero Museum, and take in the view of the city from Monserrate. Spend a day exploring Colombia’s coffee culture at Hacienda Coloma, where you can follow the bean from cultivation to the cup. The trip continues to Lake Guatavita and the Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá. Then fly to Medellín and finish your journey in Cartagena on the Caribbean coast."
    },
